{
    "id":  11598,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Circular LED Downlight 40W - Dimmable Lifud Driver - IP54 - CRI +90 UGR17",
    "reference":  "LF-90644-0-10V",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e40W LED Downlight with LIFUD dimmable driver (TRIAC, 0-10V or DALI/PUSH)\u003c/strong\u003e, ideal for professional lighting. Offers high-quality light (CRI\u0026gt;90, UGR17) without glare, \u003cstrong\u003eIP54\u003c/strong\u003e protection, and 120º beam angle for uniform coverage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003eThanks to its dimming capability, you can easily adjust light intensity according to the environment or need of the moment.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eCircular LED Downlight 40W - Dimmable Lifud Driver - IP54 - CRI +90 UGR17\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e40W LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e, fitted with a \u003cstrong\u003edimmable LIFUD driver\u003c/strong\u003e, is designed to meet the demands of professional projects requiring efficiency, versatility and high visual comfort. It is supplied \u003cstrong\u003eas standard with a Philips Certa driver\u003c/strong\u003e, which incorporates a \u003cstrong\u003ecolour temperature (CCT) selector\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing the user to choose between different light tones (warm, neutral or cool) and adapt the lighting to each space and time of day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMain Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimmable LIFUD Driver\u003c/strong\u003e: Available in three versions (TRIAC, 0–10V and DALI/PUSH), this driver allows the \u003cstrong\u003elight intensity\u003c/strong\u003e to be adjusted precisely and according to the specific needs of the environment.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCRI \u0026gt;90 and UGR\u0026lt;17\u003c/strong\u003e: Guarantees \u003cstrong\u003eexcellent colour rendering\u003c/strong\u003e, ideal for spaces where colour fidelity is essential (such as shops, offices, exhibition rooms or homes). In addition, its low glare index improves visual comfort even during prolonged use.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e120º beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e: Provides uniform, effective lighting, \u003cstrong\u003eavoiding dark areas and unwanted shadows\u003c/strong\u003e, which contributes to a more pleasant visual experience.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIP54 protection\u003c/strong\u003e: Ensures resistance to dust and water splashes, extending its installation possibilities to more demanding environments such as kitchens, bathrooms or semi-outdoor areas.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimming Options\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor projects where control of light intensity is required, the downlight can be supplied with a \u003cstrong\u003edimmable LIFUD driver\u003c/strong\u003e of your choice:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC Dimmable\u003c/strong\u003e: Model \u003cstrong\u003eLF40WTRIAC / LF-ABT040\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e Compatible with most phase-cut dimmers, ideal for domestic or basic commercial applications.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e0–10V Dimmable\u003c/strong\u003e: Model \u003cstrong\u003eLF40W0-10V / LF-ABA040\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e Recommended for installations with analogue voltage controllers, widely used in offices and retail premises.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDALI/PUSH Dimmable\u003c/strong\u003e: Model \u003cstrong\u003eLF40WDALI / LF-ADD040\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e Perfect for home automation systems or professional installations requiring \u003cstrong\u003ecentralised lighting management\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow it is connected\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis\u0026nbsp;downlight is supplied with a \u003cstrong\u003eGXtronic driver with CCT selector\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing you to choose between 3000K, 4000K and 6000K from the initial connection. If the project requires dimming, the chosen LIFUD driver will be sent \u003cstrong\u003eseparately\u003c/strong\u003e. For correct installation:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRed\u003c/strong\u003e: always positive (+)\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWhite\u003c/strong\u003e: negative for 3000K\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBlack\u003c/strong\u003e: negative for 6000K\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nFor \u003cstrong\u003e4000K\u003c/strong\u003e, both negatives must be joined together (white + black).\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e⚠️ \u003cstrong\u003eImportant\u003c/strong\u003e: LIFUD drivers do not include a CCT selector, but they do integrate \u003cstrong\u003eoutput Dip Switches\u003c/strong\u003e that allow the current — and therefore the \u003cstrong\u003efinal power of the downlight\u003c/strong\u003e — to be adjusted to the needs of the project.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecommended Applications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis downlight is ideal for:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShops and Retail\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cspan\u003eEnhances products and spaces with high-quality lighting.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExhibition Rooms and Showrooms\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cspan\u003eProvides uniform lighting that brings out details and colours.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eReception Areas and Offices\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cspan\u003eImproves visual comfort and productivity in working environments.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eKitchens, Dining Rooms and Living Rooms\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cspan\u003eProvides adaptable, efficient lighting for the home.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Benefits\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEnergy Efficiency\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cspan\u003eReduces energy consumption from first use thanks to high-performance LED technology.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong Service Life\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cspan\u003eDesigned to offer an extended service life, minimising maintenance costs.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cspan\u003eIntegrates easily into a wide range of electrical installations and lighting control systems.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide every element required for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical datasheet for each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
